  "decision_conditions": [
    "The applicants are advised this decision has not approved the street furniture, lighting and bollards, which will be covered via conditions NS65 ‘street furniture details’ which requires the submission and approved of all bins, cycle standards, seating, barriers, railings, etc prior to first occupation and condition NS55 ‘External illumination which requires approval of all external lighting, design, technical specifications, lux plans, spectrum, timings, measures to reduce spillage and implementation etc.\r\n\r\nThe applicants are advised the gates from the service road to the gardens need to be opened to allow the turning circle.  This must be achievable when considering the management of the open space.  Alternatively the gates an be removed.\r\n\r\nOfficers understand that due to maintenance concerns of the York Stone along the Embankment, an alternative natural stone is being explored.  Any change from the York Stone will need to be approved by the Local Planning Authority."
